    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_fish_sauce",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_FishSauce_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A salty, pungent sauce fermented from fish and salt. Splash it onto a plated food to season it, or sip it."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_fish_sauce",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_FishSauce_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> Drag Salted Fish Mash onto water, then leave the Young Fish Sauce for about five days.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Drag it onto a plateable food to season it (adds savoury and salty, a little pungent; each splash uses a little of the sauce). Drink it for a small amount of nourishment.\n\n<b>Keeps:</b> Spoils at half the rate of an ordinary liquid."
    },
